cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "DeepSpace Plant-Stress to Germinating-Seed Decoder (DSRS + GSAD) and seed-susceptibility atlas"
message: "If you use this software, data, or atlas, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Barker
    given-names: Richard
    affiliation: "Purdue University; The Collaborative Science Environment, PBC"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"  # placeholder — replace with real ORCID
abstract: >-
  FAIR computational tools and single-cell seed atlas for plant space biology: DSRS recognizes
  which space stressor a transcriptomic signature resembles across 49 contrasts and 15 families,
  and GSAD models a bulk transcriptome's predicted effect on dry and germinating seed cell types.
  Integrates decoupled exploration atmosphere (TabPFN v2), redox latent shifts (CVAE), and the
  MASTA empirical multi-stressor compendium.
keywords:
  - plant space biology
  - microgravity
  - germination
  - single-cell atlas
  - Arabidopsis thaliana
  - exploration atmosphere
  - redox
  - npj Microgravity
